import * as Sentry from "@sentry/tanstackstart-react";
...
Then import this file as the **first import** in your [client entry point](https://tanstack.com/start/latest/docs/framework/react/guide/client-entry-point) `src/client.tsx`.
This ensures Sentry initializes before any other code runs, so errors and events before hydration are captured.
